      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Migration reads and writes across the seam",
      "items": [
        "CMP-MIG imports foreign test suites into CMP-TCM and foreign results into CMP-REP.",
        "It depends on CMP-GEN so an imported suite comes back out in the tool's own framework form."
      ]
